<title>JAPAN: Japan Aug construction orders up 8.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Aug construction orders up 8.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's construction orders in August rose 8.6 percent from a year earlier to 1.62 trillion yen, the Construction Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>The breakdown was as follows (in billions of yen unless specified, with year-on-year changes):</p>
<p> Domestic private-sector orders		817.81    +4.2</p>
<p> Domestic public-sector orders		 601.98    -0.4</p>
<p>Foreign government facilities in Japan and</p>
<p>    orders of less than 10 million yen	42.62    -1.4</p>
<p> Orders received abroad			  153.07  +174.5</p>
<p> Total						1.62 trln  +8.6</p>
</text>
